{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not human. You are an Incarnation\u2014born from the Void by cultists who themselves cannot step into the Cursed Lands.<br>Here, even death finds no rest. But you were woven from nothing, created to walk where the living fell by the thousands. <br>Your goal is the artifact &quot;Breath of Life&quot; - the heart of an alien power, capable of awakening a dead world\u2026 or destroying it forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no heroism here. Only the cold of ruins, the whisper of the dead, and the eternal hunger for power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/extras/2f21f8656873228b050fac5409302bc0.poster.avif?t=1772120793\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/extras/2f21f8656873228b050fac5409302bc0.webm?t=1772120793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/extras/2f21f8656873228b050fac5409302bc0.mp4?t=1772120793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Refuge Village - the last place where fire still burns. A smith, merchants, and whispers of the past dwell here. From here, a portal leads into lands no living soul may tread. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places of Power - arenas where you must endure endless waves of the risen dead. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Worlds - vast regions where every step is carved through blood, scavengers, and the restless dead of a cursed land. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot &amp; Crafting - find, gather, forge, upgrade. Everything you carry from battle matters - without it, you will not survive to the next portal. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes &amp; Abilities - power is never free. Each ability has a price, and only the Rune Master knows the true cost of magic. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breath of Life is more than just a third-person action game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a journey through a land where even death cannot rest. Here, what should have long been silent rises again. Each portal is a step closer to the artifact and a step deeper into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This path was not chosen by you. But now, it belongs to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a child of the Void. Every battle brings you closer to the answer: will you become salvation\u2026 or catastrophe?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Introduction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/cf88925a9927bab55285f2227df50eba3d1443fa.jpg"},{"name":"Activation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/e514b34e28519304e33829a148278907c75a34f2.jpg"},{"name":"Path Opened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/96764e8e9d8f5e2b15ce2d80423c18643ce49641.jpg"},{"name":"Mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/f248029df639d88098fca771698e1f2394f46554.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/5d2687037b16a27eaa7be1fbbbfd065d179d2f03.jpg"},{"name":"Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/8eb668938c9f9f66fc5e889ed25f290206b3e7ce.jpg"},{"name":"Rift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3981950/d1a8e6d9e45210f04ddd32be5372310e1e389efe.jpg"},{"name":"Don\u2019t Bother Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/39819