b_paragraph\" >There is no heroism here. Only the cold of ruins, the whisper of the dead, and the eternal hunger for power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/extras/2f21f8656873228b050fac5409302bc0.poster.avif?t=1772120793\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/extras/2f21f8656873228b050fac5409302bc0.webm?t=1772120793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/extras/2f21f8656873228b050fac5409302bc0.mp4?t=1772120793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Refuge Village - the last place where fire still burns. A smith, merchants, and whispers of the past dwell here. From here, a portal leads into lands no living soul may tread. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places of Power - arenas where you must endure endless waves of the risen dead. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Worlds - vast regions where every step is carved through blood, scavengers, and the restless dead of a cursed land. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot &amp; Crafting - find, gather, forge, upgrade. Everything you carry from battle matters - without it, you will not survive to the next portal. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes &amp; Abilities - power is never free. Each ability has a price, and only the Rune Master knows the true cost of magic. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breath of Life is more than just a third-person action game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a journey through a land where even death cannot rest. Here, what should have long been silent rises again. Each portal is a step closer to the artifact and a step deeper into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This path was not chosen by you. But now, it belongs to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a child of the Void. Every battle brings you closer to the answer: will you become salvation\u2026 or catastrophe?</p>","developers":["Satur Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981950/0830dc98e7243f58876a64fe5c61b26ec0dcf031/header.jpg?t=1772120793","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981950/386123401/ff06b236a76532e0f624f85d16cc871cacde5b09/1756150225/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758092508","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981950/386123401/ff06b236a76532e0f624f85d16cc871cacde5b09/1756150225/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758092508","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981950/386123401/ff06b236a76532e0f624f85d16cc871cacde5b09/1756150225/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758092508","id":257188718,"name":"Breath of Life Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188718/b8fab0a087f4f8e69b29a352159783393d7706f6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758092508"}],"name":"Breath of Life","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"